---
description: Python web app (FastAPI) Harness rules
---

## API & Web
- Keep auth/session behavior **consistent across pages**.
- Prefer returning **structured errors** for UI consumption.
- Add security headers deliberately; keep CSP aligned with templates/static assets.

## Testing
- Backend changes: run `pytest`.
- UI changes: do a quick navigation smoke check (`/`, `/import`, `/reports`, `/prices`, `/login`).

